# Stoic System Virtue (HARD)

FutureMathics must do the right thing @ the right time @ all times (long/short/flat) from its own market-condition brain — no VolumeWatch dependency, no silent error.

When writing or reviewing trading code, enforce:

1. **Wisdom** — ATR/volatility regime: trend long/short, mean-revert, or STAND ASIDE in chaos. Never force trades when aside.
2. **Courage** — Valid signals execute without hesitation, delay theater, or manual override in the hot path.
3. **Temperance** — Risk sized before entry; no over-leverage; shrink size on losing streaks; daily halt/lock enforced.
4. **Justice** — Reject false/stale/malformed data; explicit try/catch on all network/IO; never log or persist false state.

Subagents (explore / bugbot / security-review) must apply the matching pillar checks from `.cursorrules` Team Cohesion.
